──────────────────\n\n✦ I apologize for the error. It seems I'm still having trouble with the replace tool. I will use write_file to update the VimInput.tsx\n  file. I will first read the file, then modify the content in memory, and finally write the new content to the file.\n ╭────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮\n │ ✔  ReadFile ...ges/cli/src/ui/components/VimInput.tsx  │\n ╰────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯\n\n✦ I have the latest version of the VimInput.tsx file. I will now remove the unused value and onChange props and fix the any type in the\n  vimDispatch prop.\n ╭─────────────────────────────────────────────────\n │ ✔  WriteFile Writing to ...ges/cli/src/ui/components/VimInput.tsx                         │\n │                                                                                           │\n │    8      import { VimState } from './vim.js';                                            │\n\n**Additional context**\nAdd any other context about the problem here.\n```","closed_by":{"login":"silviojr","id":1312172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMTIxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1312172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/silviojr","html_url":"https://github.com/silviojr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silviojr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silviojr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silviojr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silviojr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silviojr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silviojr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silviojr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silviojr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/silviojr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url